WEBVTT

01:27.345 --> 01:28.265
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.345 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 8

01:39.665 --> 01:41.465
All the poisons
have already been destroyed.

01:42.545 --> 01:44.585
Why then does the Begonia Pendant
still react so strangely?

01:46.185 --> 01:48.465
Could it be that there are still
other toxins hidden within the palace?

01:51.425 --> 01:52.905
Princess Ying's mind is unclear.

01:53.705 --> 01:55.065
Her words cannot be taken as truth.

02:04.985 --> 02:07.425
Your Majesty, Your Highness,

02:07.505 --> 02:09.024
I mean no disrespect.

02:09.105 --> 02:10.345
It is by His Majesty's command.

02:10.945 --> 02:13.465
Should a single lamp
be lit in this cold palace,

02:13.545 --> 02:15.385
a guard's life must be taken in exchange.

02:16.385 --> 02:17.865
I'm truly fearful.

02:44.305 --> 02:45.145
Ying.

02:47.985 --> 02:49.785
Ying. Ying.

03:00.985 --> 03:01.945
Ying.

03:02.985 --> 03:04.065
I'm your brother.

03:04.705 --> 03:05.545
I have come to see you.

03:09.865 --> 03:10.705
Qianqing!

03:20.225 --> 03:21.145
Come.

03:24.065 --> 03:24.905
Ying.

03:25.625 --> 03:27.105
It's so cold,

03:27.185 --> 03:28.985
remember to keep your shoes on
from now on.

03:40.265 --> 03:42.305
Ying. Stop painting.

03:43.065 --> 03:44.625
Your brother and I have come to see you.

03:48.705 --> 03:49.545
Ying.

03:50.145 --> 03:52.625
I brought you osmanthus
and red bean dumplings.

03:53.185 --> 03:55.705
After you eat them,
you should go to sleep early.

04:00.265 --> 04:02.025
How did you know I like these?

04:09.865 --> 04:10.985
Who are you?

04:16.065 --> 04:17.184
Then do you want to eat them?

04:19.745 --> 04:22.625
When I've killed them all, then I'll eat.

04:23.625 --> 04:24.465
Kill whom?

04:44.145 --> 04:45.425
Why don't you help me,

04:49.385 --> 04:50.225
and kill them all?

05:13.265 --> 05:15.105
Mother, this teacup is exquisite.

05:16.145 --> 05:17.465
Fine porcelain, so clear and delicate.

05:19.705 --> 05:22.465
Ying's illness has always come and gone.

05:23.745 --> 05:25.025
After much effort to nurse her,

05:25.105 --> 05:27.705
her confusion still outweighs her clarity.

05:28.665 --> 05:32.505
That Xiao Huan
is determined to take our lives!

05:34.185 --> 05:35.185
Mother.

05:36.145 --> 05:39.385
Ying gave poison to the Empress,
and attempted to assassinate His Majesty.

05:40.065 --> 05:42.145
She was only punished by ten days
without lighting a lamp.

05:42.225 --> 05:44.105
That punishment
is already merciful enough.

05:45.425 --> 05:47.465
Ying has never been of sound mind.

05:47.545 --> 05:50.385
-But why did she become this way?
-You know the reason well.

05:50.985 --> 05:53.745
Had it not been for that great fire
at Luling Palace back then,

05:53.825 --> 05:55.145
when Xiao Huan abandoned her,

05:55.745 --> 05:57.465
she would never
have been so deeply scarred.

05:57.545 --> 06:00.425
Then why did Luling Palace
suddenly burn for no reason?

06:01.065 --> 06:01.905
What do you mean by that?

06:04.745 --> 06:06.665
You are my own flesh and blood,

06:06.745 --> 06:10.225
the child I carried for ten months,
born through hardship and pain.

06:10.305 --> 06:13.985
Do you not know why,
or for whom, I have done all this?

06:21.505 --> 06:24.105
So Mother has always known
the truth behind Ying's madness,

06:24.705 --> 06:25.985
yet chose never to tell her,

06:26.985 --> 06:28.745
encouraging her
instead to resent His Majesty.

06:29.465 --> 06:32.105
Is this, Mother,
what you call love for me and Ying?

06:42.745 --> 06:43.865
So,

06:45.745 --> 06:47.905
it is because of your sister's matter

06:48.745 --> 06:49.745
that you have borne a grudge
against me all this time.

06:51.025 --> 06:53.105
You were in Southern Chu
for so many years,

06:53.625 --> 06:55.745
yet not once did you send a letter home.

06:56.505 --> 07:00.705
Whatever I asked you to do,
you brushed aside carelessly, and even

07:01.425 --> 07:02.545
stood against me.

07:08.545 --> 07:11.105
Mother. You speak too harshly.

07:19.905 --> 07:20.945
Does it hurt?

07:22.865 --> 07:23.985
It does not.

07:28.465 --> 07:29.305
Mother,

07:30.305 --> 07:31.225
please be at ease.

07:32.145 --> 07:33.665
Now that I have returned,

07:34.265 --> 07:37.025
I shall protect you and my sister
with all that I am.

07:37.105 --> 07:38.225
I will never let
either of you suffer again.

07:39.305 --> 07:40.825
The injustice Ying endured,

07:42.225 --> 07:43.625
I will never forget.

08:28.185 --> 08:30.065
Well? Did you meet His Majesty?

08:30.145 --> 08:31.225
Does that mean I can stop practicing?

08:31.305 --> 08:35.065
Look at me, do I look like I've met him?

08:38.185 --> 08:39.225
Then what should we do?

08:40.144 --> 08:42.465
His Majesty could summon
Song Lanxi at any moment.

08:42.545 --> 08:43.545
He values him so highly.

08:44.585 --> 08:45.985
Even if I practice until I'm perfect,

08:46.065 --> 08:48.065
the moment His Majesty
sees the real one, I'll be exposed.

08:48.585 --> 08:51.465
His Majesty is gravely ill now.

08:51.545 --> 08:53.065
He is unlikely to grant
an audience for the time being.

08:54.145 --> 08:56.585
As for you, put your mind
to practicing your calligraphy first.

08:56.665 --> 08:59.385
We'll talk once you've fooled
the officials in the Capital.

09:00.145 --> 09:01.745
Come, show me.

09:07.905 --> 09:10.145
Your writing does resemble his,

09:10.945 --> 09:11.945
yet it still lacks spirit.

09:12.825 --> 09:14.905
Anyone who has seen Song Lanxi's true work

09:14.985 --> 09:16.065
will see through it at a glance.

09:17.545 --> 09:20.985
Song Lanxi is a master of calligraphy.

09:21.065 --> 09:23.745
A four chi scroll of his sells for
more than a hundred liang of silver.

09:24.265 --> 09:26.185
How could that be copied so easily?

09:28.425 --> 09:32.185
At the start, you insisted
on accompanying me to the Capital.

09:32.865 --> 09:36.105
You boasted
as if nothing were beyond your ability.

09:37.625 --> 09:38.985
I said I wished to go to
the Capital with you,

09:39.825 --> 09:41.585
but did I say I meant
to impersonate Song Lanxi?

09:42.265 --> 09:44.345
If you think my writing is poor,
do it yourself if you can.

09:48.425 --> 09:51.785
This robe of mine is suited to
the Dragon Boat Festival season.

09:51.865 --> 09:53.385
It is costly and difficult to make, you…

09:55.105 --> 09:55.945
What now?

10:05.185 --> 10:06.265
-What are you doing?
-Do not move.

10:10.905 --> 10:12.265
TURTLE

10:13.865 --> 10:16.025
Do not be angry, Your Highness.
Please look.

10:16.105 --> 10:17.265
This is the character
I have practiced for over a month,

10:17.345 --> 10:19.065
the one that most resembles his writing.

10:19.145 --> 10:19.905
TURTLE

10:19.985 --> 10:20.825
Here.

10:23.905 --> 10:25.545
TURTLE

10:27.105 --> 10:28.625
TURTLE

10:34.825 --> 10:36.705
Characters like this,
how many can you write?

10:38.185 --> 10:41.505
I can write not many.

10:42.625 --> 10:44.465
-About two hundred or so…
-Two hundred or so?

10:46.185 --> 10:47.905
Come, write them all for me.

10:49.545 --> 10:50.825
Quickly. Sit.

10:51.665 --> 10:53.505
Come, write.

11:00.945 --> 11:02.225
Your Highness, you're blocking the light.

11:11.305 --> 11:13.065
I can't have anyone standing here
when I'm writing.

11:16.225 --> 11:17.105
Fine.

11:21.345 --> 11:22.145
Hurry and write.

11:31.265 --> 11:33.065
For the Grand Tutor's kindness to me,

11:33.145 --> 11:34.825
I would give my body and soul,
and repay it fully.

11:35.625 --> 11:36.745
At the palace examination,

11:37.305 --> 11:40.265
I will take first place.

11:40.345 --> 11:41.305
Good.

11:42.585 --> 11:43.625
You may go.

11:49.945 --> 11:52.665
Well? Any word of Cangcang?

11:53.705 --> 11:55.145
She claimed she was going to
the Summer Palace,

11:55.225 --> 11:56.305
but went to the Sword Cottage instead.

12:01.385 --> 12:05.465
It seems her visit to
the Sword Cottage isn't simple.

12:06.785 --> 12:08.065
Then Father means…

12:11.185 --> 12:12.905
Regarding Li Lu's death,

12:14.665 --> 12:16.185
she has never let it go.

12:20.345 --> 12:22.185
How is the truth

12:23.545 --> 12:24.985
she seeks coming along?

13:04.465 --> 13:05.465
Master.

13:06.545 --> 13:07.905
I miss you.

13:09.145 --> 13:10.865
The longer I stay in the palace,

13:11.385 --> 13:14.345
the more I miss
the carefree days I had here.

13:16.105 --> 13:17.625
But you're gone.

13:18.705 --> 13:20.825
Xiao Huan won't even give me a reason.

13:22.825 --> 13:23.865
Master,

13:24.905 --> 13:26.625
what exactly were you all hiding from me?

13:29.185 --> 13:32.545
The imperial family is heartless,
yet Xiao Huan keeps helping me.

13:32.625 --> 13:33.905
Why is that?

13:35.985 --> 13:37.745
Why did you kill my master?

13:39.545 --> 13:42.785
I promised him I wouldn't tell you.

13:48.945 --> 13:49.945
What did you say?

13:55.105 --> 13:56.345
What aren't you allowed to tell me?

14:01.425 --> 14:03.705
What are you all hiding from me?

14:22.385 --> 14:23.745
You're back, little glutton.

14:25.705 --> 14:27.945
What do you want to eat?
I will make it for you.

14:36.505 --> 14:37.825
Master, is it ready?

14:38.425 --> 14:40.825
What gift are you giving me?

14:42.945 --> 14:44.025
You may open your eyes now.

14:48.585 --> 14:50.265
What a beautiful pendant.

14:50.345 --> 14:52.585
This is a protector I give you.

14:52.665 --> 14:54.705
You must keep it with you from now on.

14:54.785 --> 14:55.945
Well? Do you like it?

14:56.625 --> 14:57.625
I do.

14:57.705 --> 15:00.345
Father never remembers my birthday.

15:00.425 --> 15:02.465
Master is much better than Father.

15:02.545 --> 15:04.825
Thank you, Master. I really like it.

15:04.905 --> 15:06.305
As long as you like it.

15:11.185 --> 15:12.065
Master,

15:14.385 --> 15:15.905
can you tell me

15:18.585 --> 15:20.505
why Xiao Huan

15:22.345 --> 15:23.825
had to kill you?

15:27.985 --> 15:28.825
Who?

15:31.745 --> 15:32.585
Luo.

15:33.465 --> 15:34.385
Cangcang.

15:44.825 --> 15:47.065
Speak. Why are you here?

15:50.145 --> 15:52.705
I came to pay my respects too,
to share a drink with him.

15:59.345 --> 16:02.705
But Master never drank Bamboo Leaf Green.

16:08.665 --> 16:10.785
Are you really here to pay respects?

16:20.105 --> 16:20.945
Cangcang,

16:21.825 --> 16:22.825
Father

16:24.145 --> 16:25.025
was worried about you.

16:32.465 --> 16:33.785
Luo,

16:35.545 --> 16:37.425
do you still remember this pendant?

16:38.265 --> 16:40.105
This Begonia Pendant

16:43.145 --> 16:45.025
was given to me by Master.

16:46.065 --> 16:47.545
He said it would keep me safe.

16:57.105 --> 16:58.185
I remember.

16:59.945 --> 17:01.425
I only learned recently

17:02.185 --> 17:04.464
that it is a treasure beyond price.

17:05.145 --> 17:06.345
With it on me,

17:07.745 --> 17:10.464
no poison can get close.

17:13.305 --> 17:15.265
Master was protecting me all along.

17:20.745 --> 17:23.305
But I do not even know why he died.

17:29.985 --> 17:32.345
I do not even know why he died!

17:33.705 --> 17:35.105
Am I that useless?

17:44.225 --> 17:45.305
Cang…

17:56.505 --> 17:57.545
Cangcang.

18:06.745 --> 18:08.265
I remember when I was little,

18:09.905 --> 18:12.225
I loved leaning against this forge.

18:13.025 --> 18:14.785
No matter how cold it was outside,

18:15.385 --> 18:16.985
it was always warm here.

18:53.785 --> 18:55.265
Tell me,

18:57.465 --> 18:59.585
when have you ever approached me

19:01.385 --> 19:02.345
without a purpose?

19:05.625 --> 19:07.705
No, My Lady. It was Father…

19:08.305 --> 19:10.785
Master forged the Rex Sword for you

19:12.185 --> 19:14.625
and you used that very sword to kill him.

19:17.025 --> 19:19.105
-How am I supposed to trust you again?
-I…

19:22.305 --> 19:25.345
How am I supposed
to grow old at your side,

19:26.305 --> 19:28.025
to live with you in harmony?

19:28.785 --> 19:31.305
Since I became empress,
I've swallowed every grievance.

19:32.225 --> 19:33.465
In the palace,

19:34.545 --> 19:37.105
there hasn't been a single day
I didn't try to uncover the truth!

19:39.305 --> 19:40.705
Tell me the truth!

19:44.705 --> 19:47.345
Do you want me to hate you
for the rest of my life?

19:52.345 --> 19:53.305
Do you

19:55.025 --> 19:56.305
not want to hate me?

19:58.905 --> 19:59.825
I…

20:06.425 --> 20:07.985
I don't want to hate you.

20:12.985 --> 20:15.465
I don't want to hate you!

20:26.025 --> 20:27.825
I hate myself.

20:30.065 --> 20:31.265
Once,

20:34.105 --> 20:35.385
I even thought

20:36.665 --> 20:39.305
of roaming the world with you,
sword in hand.

20:42.145 --> 20:43.305
Leave.

20:44.505 --> 20:45.385
Go!

20:47.425 --> 20:48.625
Stay away from me.

20:50.905 --> 20:52.505
I don't want to see you.

21:02.265 --> 21:03.505
Master.

21:08.825 --> 21:10.225
Master…

21:13.625 --> 21:15.265
I want to…

21:16.705 --> 21:19.105
I want to learn sword-forging from you.

21:20.145 --> 21:21.705
I'll stay here

21:24.385 --> 21:25.745
and wait for you.

21:48.505 --> 21:49.585
So,

21:50.825 --> 21:51.985
you still love him.

21:55.945 --> 21:57.345
After everything,

21:58.905 --> 21:59.905
you still…

22:03.145 --> 22:04.665
You still love him.

22:43.825 --> 22:45.905
Cangcang, you're awake.

22:48.185 --> 22:49.425
You drank too much last night.

22:50.065 --> 22:50.905
Cangcang,

22:50.985 --> 22:53.625
do you remember what you said last night?

22:54.905 --> 22:55.745
What did I say?

22:59.225 --> 23:00.265
You didn't say anything.

23:09.065 --> 23:12.225
Strange, I remember
it being so warm here last night.

23:13.625 --> 23:15.265
How come this morning,
now that the sun is out,

23:15.345 --> 23:16.665
it's suddenly chilly?

23:17.945 --> 23:19.985
I remember there was a cellar
at home once,

23:20.065 --> 23:22.065
just like this,
warm in winter and cool in summer.

23:35.065 --> 23:36.105
Strange,

23:36.745 --> 23:38.225
why is there a cold draft here?

23:38.985 --> 23:39.905
Cangcang.

23:44.545 --> 23:47.065
Could it be there's a cellar here too?

23:49.585 --> 23:50.505
Let's look.

24:00.185 --> 24:01.225
Cangcang.

24:06.145 --> 24:07.145
Try this.

24:10.745 --> 24:11.745
It's so cold.

24:15.785 --> 24:16.865
Why is the wind so strong?

24:17.825 --> 24:19.825
Could it be there's a cellar underneath,

24:21.185 --> 24:22.505
connected to Sword Cottage?

24:25.265 --> 24:26.105
Take out the sword.

25:04.625 --> 25:05.745
I didn't expect Master

25:07.145 --> 25:08.425
had hidden a place like this.

25:13.105 --> 25:14.065
Cangcang, look.

25:15.265 --> 25:16.385
These belong to Tang.

25:19.865 --> 25:21.225
Every time I mentioned Tang,

25:22.345 --> 25:23.865
Master would say it was in the past.

25:26.425 --> 25:28.945
But in his heart, he never really let go.

25:41.185 --> 25:42.105
This is…

25:50.585 --> 25:51.665
This isn't Master's wife.

25:52.705 --> 25:53.865
I remember how she looked,

25:53.945 --> 25:56.105
round-faced,
with a mole at the corner of her mouth.

25:57.145 --> 25:58.185
Then this…

25:59.825 --> 26:01.265
How could her portrait be here
with Master?

26:04.985 --> 26:06.505
These eyebrows and eyes,

26:08.385 --> 26:09.985
why do they look so familiar?

26:10.945 --> 26:12.985
Cangcang, let's verify this later.

26:23.705 --> 26:25.665
This is the Ghost King's mask.

26:26.185 --> 26:27.865
How could it be
in your master's Sword Cottage?

26:37.145 --> 26:38.145
This is…

26:41.505 --> 26:42.545
How could this be?

26:44.785 --> 26:45.745
How could this be?

26:46.425 --> 26:48.785
Cangcang, look at this.

26:49.665 --> 26:51.825
STONE MAN PRACTICING GU ARTS

26:52.745 --> 26:53.985
Stone Man…

26:56.665 --> 26:57.505
Secret art…

27:07.825 --> 27:09.465
This is the secret art
of the Ghost King of the Lingbi Sect.

27:11.345 --> 27:12.665
Could it be that Mr. Li Lu is…

27:19.545 --> 27:20.465
Impossible.

27:25.145 --> 27:26.305
I don't believe it!

27:29.985 --> 27:31.945
How many days has the Empress been away?

27:32.625 --> 27:34.265
Report to Your Majesty,
it's been fewer than five days.

27:35.145 --> 27:36.065
Any news?

27:36.985 --> 27:37.825
None that I've heard.

27:39.145 --> 27:40.265
Your Majesty.

27:41.425 --> 27:43.505
Has the Empress sent any word back?

27:43.585 --> 27:44.425
Her Majesty's letters are not here,

27:45.265 --> 27:46.985
but there are a few of
Mr. Song Lanxi's writings

27:47.065 --> 27:48.745
that leaked from
the Prince of Yuzhang's Manor.

27:50.065 --> 27:52.425
Why would Song Lanxi
be staying in the manor?

27:52.505 --> 27:55.145
He said he was injured on the road
and needed to recuperate at the manor.

28:26.065 --> 28:27.625
I have received some good news.

28:28.345 --> 28:29.505
Though perhaps not entirely good news.

28:30.265 --> 28:31.545
Some bad…

28:32.105 --> 28:34.785
-Though not exactly bad.
-What news?

28:40.385 --> 28:42.625
His Majesty just issued an order:
Because he is seriously ill,

28:43.225 --> 28:45.465
the final imperial exam is postponed.

28:45.545 --> 28:46.585
It's good news.

28:47.545 --> 28:50.625
But I wonder, could it be

28:51.305 --> 28:52.625
because he discovered something?

28:53.225 --> 28:55.465
Impersonating Song Lanxi in the Capital
is a capital offense.

28:56.185 --> 28:58.145
I am also complicit.

28:58.225 --> 28:59.065
Naturally, I shall protect you.

28:59.825 --> 29:02.105
If you want to go, go yourself.
I'm not going.

29:03.385 --> 29:06.825
After Ling Cangcang entered the palace,
the first gift she received…

29:07.705 --> 29:09.105
Do you know what it was?

29:10.425 --> 29:11.345
What was it?

29:18.705 --> 29:22.025
A finger of her adoptive brother,
Luo Xianxue.

29:27.145 --> 29:28.105
So,

29:29.065 --> 29:30.585
you may not trust me.

29:31.105 --> 29:33.705
Between us, there is no common interest.

29:35.425 --> 29:38.665
However, we share a common enemy.

29:41.265 --> 29:42.625
Then what should we do?

29:43.225 --> 29:44.745
If he discovers
I'm impersonating Song Lanxi,

29:44.825 --> 29:46.185
you must save me.

29:49.465 --> 29:51.105
Your Highness,
Mr. Xu Feng, requests an audience.

29:51.185 --> 29:52.345
Which Mr. Xu?

29:52.425 --> 29:53.265
-No.
-No.

29:54.345 --> 29:56.465
He is a student of Mr. Ling Xuefeng.

29:57.865 --> 29:59.065
Ling Xuefeng?

30:01.305 --> 30:02.545
What should we do?

30:09.105 --> 30:09.945
Your Highness,

30:10.465 --> 30:13.185
I heard that Mr. Song Lanxi
has been ill for a long time,

30:13.265 --> 30:15.145
and Grand Tutor Ling is very concerned.

30:15.225 --> 30:18.345
This is Physician Liu,
a miraculous healer.

30:20.465 --> 30:23.945
Grand Tutor specifically sent him here
to diagnose Mr. Song.

30:25.025 --> 30:26.585
To be honest,

30:27.665 --> 30:30.385
Mr. Song's condition is indeed serious.

30:31.145 --> 30:32.185
To be precise,

30:32.785 --> 30:36.065
on the way here,
he was attacked by assassins,

30:36.145 --> 30:36.985
and the injuries were severe.

30:40.025 --> 30:41.065
Then, in that case,

30:41.665 --> 30:43.465
please summon Mr. Song.

31:17.985 --> 31:20.705
Mr. Song, have you disguised yourself?

31:21.305 --> 31:23.185
Mr. Song was severely injured
on the head and neck

31:23.265 --> 31:25.865
when on the way to the Capital.

31:26.625 --> 31:28.025
His vocal cords were damaged,

31:28.825 --> 31:30.585
and he cannot speak for now.

31:39.945 --> 31:41.545
Since the injuries are severe,

31:42.385 --> 31:45.025
-Physician Liu, please take care of him.
-Yes.

31:47.505 --> 31:49.385
Mr. Song was attacked in the night,

31:49.465 --> 31:50.585
and was greatly frightened.

31:50.665 --> 31:53.865
Since then, he has refused
any physical contact with others.

31:59.465 --> 32:02.585
Mr. Song,
I have admired you for a long time.

32:02.665 --> 32:04.505
Your calligraphy is renowned
throughout the land.

32:04.585 --> 32:05.425
Now that I see you,

32:05.505 --> 32:08.785
I wonder if you might grant me
a few characters.

32:11.185 --> 32:12.345
This…

32:14.625 --> 32:17.185
Mr. Song's calligraphy
was already circulated yesterday.

32:17.265 --> 32:21.825
Why can't he display it publicly today?

32:23.665 --> 32:25.545
Xu Feng, you are taking this too far!

32:33.145 --> 32:34.145
But

32:34.825 --> 32:37.465
since you are Grand Tutor Ling's student,

32:38.465 --> 32:41.625
I naturally have to show him some respect.

32:45.705 --> 32:46.745
Mr. Song,

32:47.345 --> 32:48.865
what do you think?

32:53.425 --> 32:55.545
Someone, bring ink and brushes.

32:59.545 --> 33:02.425
WUYING HALL

33:02.505 --> 33:04.545
CALLIGRAPHY OF SONG LANXI

33:06.505 --> 33:08.665
Song Lanxi has always been modest.

33:08.745 --> 33:10.465
Why has so much calligraphy
been circulated?

33:11.065 --> 33:13.145
It is said that too many people
came to request his writing,

33:13.225 --> 33:15.585
and Prince of Yuzhang had no choice
but to ask Mr. Song to comply.

33:17.505 --> 33:18.585
I doubt it.

33:19.185 --> 33:20.305
Your Majesty, what seems off?

33:21.745 --> 33:24.505
Along the way,
there were too many strange things.

33:25.265 --> 33:26.745
Since Your Majesty is doubtful,

33:26.825 --> 33:28.865
then when the Prince of Yuzhang came
to request an audience a few days ago,

33:28.945 --> 33:29.865
why didn't you ask directly?

33:29.945 --> 33:32.105
I had just punished Xiao Ying,

33:32.625 --> 33:35.265
and if I saw him now,
wouldn't it only cause trouble?

33:48.825 --> 33:50.945
After all this time,
unable to master a single character of Xi.

33:54.265 --> 33:55.305
Your Highness.

33:58.225 --> 33:59.265
TAKE CARE OF YOURSELF

34:14.304 --> 34:15.145
TAKE CARE OF YOURSELF, SONG LAN

34:21.625 --> 34:23.625
Song Lanxi of the Western Garden
in Guzhou,

34:24.304 --> 34:25.225
a character worth a thousand gold coins.

34:26.304 --> 34:28.264
This writing is now given to you.

34:30.225 --> 34:31.225
Since that's the case,

34:31.744 --> 34:34.385
I wish Mr. Song a speedy recovery.

34:36.264 --> 34:39.025
Your Highness, I take my leave.

34:55.105 --> 34:56.545
I'm suffocating.

34:56.625 --> 34:58.345
No.

34:58.425 --> 34:59.585
I nearly died of fright!

35:00.345 --> 35:02.665
If Xu Feng found out, I'd be finished!

35:02.745 --> 35:04.185
If I'm caught impersonating
an imperial official,

35:04.265 --> 35:06.065
how many heads do I have
for Xiao Huan to chop off?

35:07.185 --> 35:08.505
I can't believe you even know that!

35:22.385 --> 35:25.145
How dare you let Zhong Lin
impersonate Song Lanxi?

35:27.305 --> 35:29.585
Song Lanxi was assassinated
by your father-in-law.

35:30.505 --> 35:32.505
If I hadn't done it,
how could I have kept it from him?

35:32.585 --> 35:34.705
Kept it from him, or kept it from me?

35:34.785 --> 35:35.825
As soon as I returned,

35:35.905 --> 35:38.065
I came straight to the palace
to confess to you.

35:38.145 --> 35:39.025
But you refused to see me.

35:40.945 --> 35:43.305
I haven't yet punished you
for failing to protect him,

35:43.385 --> 35:45.145
and you blame me instead.

35:46.545 --> 35:48.585
Fine. Fine.

35:48.665 --> 35:50.785
Then please punish me, Your Majesty.

35:51.505 --> 35:54.425
It would be best to punish
Zhong Lin's crime along with mine.

35:56.545 --> 35:59.265
Are you trying to use
Zhong Lin to threaten me?

36:01.025 --> 36:02.025
I wouldn't dare.

36:02.745 --> 36:04.625
Zhong Lin is just a commoner.

36:04.705 --> 36:06.385
How could she
possibly threaten Your Majesty?

36:07.265 --> 36:11.065
But I heard that
the Empress misses her dearly.

36:14.865 --> 36:17.105
Then you will bear Zhong Lin's crime.

36:24.905 --> 36:26.785
Your Highness, you just saw for yourself.

36:27.425 --> 36:29.665
Ling Xuefeng's people already believe

36:29.745 --> 36:32.305
that Song Lanxi
is living safely in my manor.

36:32.385 --> 36:34.065
If you punish me now,

36:34.145 --> 36:38.465
wouldn't that cause pain
to loved ones and joy to enemies?

36:39.505 --> 36:42.505
So this is your plan.

36:44.185 --> 36:46.505
You're using Ling Xuefeng to pressure me.

36:47.265 --> 36:48.545
I wouldn't dare.

36:49.225 --> 36:51.145
If Ling Xuefeng knew that
Song Lanxi was dead,

36:51.985 --> 36:53.705
it would benefit neither of us.

36:54.305 --> 36:56.465
Why not maintain the lie together?

36:57.585 --> 36:59.305
You truly have a lot of nerve.

37:03.145 --> 37:04.265
Your Majesty, please calm your anger.

37:04.345 --> 37:05.185
I am trembling with fear.

37:11.505 --> 37:15.145
Having me cover the lie for you
is not entirely impossible.

37:15.865 --> 37:17.785
But you must do
one thing for me in return.

37:19.185 --> 37:20.505
What is it?

37:20.585 --> 37:22.745
Have you heard of Li Chengtian?

37:25.865 --> 37:27.025
Li Chengtian?

37:27.625 --> 37:28.905
He was once a senior minister
in the court.

37:29.425 --> 37:31.785
After losing to Ling Xuefeng,
he retired to the countryside.

37:32.745 --> 37:35.145
Yet his name remains illustrious
among the gentry.

37:35.745 --> 37:38.225
Many upright officials in the court
were his students.

37:39.065 --> 37:41.105
Song Lanxi was also his student.

37:41.185 --> 37:42.265
Indeed.

37:43.025 --> 37:44.745
Your Majesty is truly cunning
and strategic.

37:45.505 --> 37:49.025
So Song Lanxi was merely
a lure to draw out Li Chengtian.

37:51.545 --> 37:53.585
Ling Xuefeng killed his beloved student.

37:54.305 --> 37:55.465
What would he feel?

37:56.985 --> 38:00.745
Your Majesty intends for me to summon
Master Li out of retirement.

38:03.945 --> 38:05.025
What do you think?

38:09.665 --> 38:13.345
TAKE CARE, SONG LAN

38:22.785 --> 38:23.625
Greetings, Father.

38:26.505 --> 38:28.185
Song Lanxi is not dead.

38:29.505 --> 38:31.665
Impossible. I personally struck him down.

38:33.025 --> 38:34.345
TAKE CARE, SONG LAN

38:34.425 --> 38:36.425
This is Song Lanxi's calligraphy.

38:38.945 --> 38:41.305
Since you personally attacked him,

38:41.905 --> 38:44.225
there must be hidden circumstances.

38:45.745 --> 38:47.425
I will investigate further.

38:48.625 --> 38:49.905
Get up.

38:50.585 --> 38:53.745
All traces of Li Lu's interactions with us
should be cleared away.

38:55.025 --> 38:57.265
Rest assured, Father.
Everything has been properly handled.

38:58.225 --> 38:59.065
But…

39:03.665 --> 39:05.585
I know you cannot bear it.

39:06.265 --> 39:09.305
And as a father, neither can I.

39:10.185 --> 39:13.185
Yet this is the truth
she most wishes to know.

39:14.345 --> 39:16.745
It is also what she must face.

39:18.305 --> 39:20.345
But Young Lady refuses to believe that
Li Lu is the Ghost King,

39:20.865 --> 39:21.985
thinking instead that someone framed him.

39:22.945 --> 39:25.025
-Who does she suspect?
-She has not mentioned it.

39:25.705 --> 39:27.265
She is heading straight to the palace now.

39:32.105 --> 39:34.585
WUYING HALL

39:35.745 --> 39:38.385
Is the Empress's favourite
pear blossom honey all ready?

39:38.905 --> 39:40.385
Prepared long ago.

39:44.745 --> 39:47.185
Your Majesty, the Empress has arrived.

39:55.905 --> 39:58.945
Why does Your Majesty
look so surprised to see me?

40:00.665 --> 40:01.945
I just thought

40:02.025 --> 40:04.585
you would be happier to step out
of the palace for a while.

40:07.185 --> 40:08.025
Why should I be happy?

40:16.345 --> 40:18.185
This is pear blossom honey
from this year's harvest.

40:18.265 --> 40:19.625
Taste it.

40:22.665 --> 40:23.745
You haven't finished speaking.

40:24.425 --> 40:25.265
Why would I

40:25.945 --> 40:27.025
be happy?

40:45.065 --> 40:46.065
Should I be happy

40:46.825 --> 40:48.265
that my master is the Ghost King?

40:51.185 --> 40:52.385
What are you talking about?

40:53.145 --> 40:55.145
All along, you've had people following me,

40:55.225 --> 40:56.305
never leaving my side.

40:56.385 --> 40:57.505
Don't you know what I'm talking about?

40:58.265 --> 41:01.105
I had them follow you to protect you.

41:01.185 --> 41:02.825
Since you admit it,

41:03.345 --> 41:05.305
then the items of the Ghost King
in the Sword Cottage…

41:05.385 --> 41:06.585
You were the one who placed them?

41:07.425 --> 41:10.425
You are suspecting me
of framing your master?

41:11.625 --> 41:12.985
No.

41:13.065 --> 41:16.465
If I truly wanted to frame your master,
why wait until today?

41:33.985 --> 41:35.185
Then tell me,

41:37.065 --> 41:38.385
why did you kill my master?

41:38.985 --> 41:40.305
I promised your master

41:41.065 --> 41:42.465
I wouldn't reveal the truth to you.

41:46.185 --> 41:47.105
Fine.

41:48.225 --> 41:49.305
I'll find out myself.

41:49.945 --> 41:52.585
Cangcang, have you considered

41:53.225 --> 41:55.785
that perhaps the truth
is more than you can bear?

41:55.865 --> 41:57.665
If I didn't know the truth,

41:58.945 --> 42:00.025
how could I bear it?

42:12.505 --> 42:13.825
Ling Xuefeng,

42:15.305 --> 42:17.505
are you betting that
I wouldn't break my vow?

42:17.585 --> 42:19.065
Grand Tutor Ling has been kind to me.

42:20.025 --> 42:22.625
He helped me avenge my daughter's wrongs.

42:24.265 --> 42:27.225
He allowed me to live again.

42:27.305 --> 42:29.705
For him, I would face mountains
of blades and seas of fire,

42:30.305 --> 42:33.105
even if my soul were to shatter,
I would not hesitate.

42:34.185 --> 42:37.265
If I told you that it was Ling Xuefeng

42:38.065 --> 42:39.145
who abducted your daughter?

42:41.385 --> 42:42.345
All of this

42:43.065 --> 42:46.065
was orchestrated by him as a bitter ruse.

42:47.665 --> 42:48.585
Impossible.

42:50.505 --> 42:51.665
It's impossible.

42:53.585 --> 42:56.225
Everything I saw was real.

42:57.585 --> 43:00.785
Everything I did was of my own free will.

43:01.505 --> 43:03.145
I was not used by anyone.

43:04.305 --> 43:05.465
I will never regret it.

43:06.825 --> 43:07.705
Is that so?

43:08.425 --> 43:11.185
Then these words,
would you dare to say them to Cangcang?

43:19.145 --> 43:20.745
Do not tell Cangcang the truth.

43:22.345 --> 43:23.385
Understood.

43:24.065 --> 43:27.105
A promise from the sovereign
is never broken.
